    "content": {
     "content_type": "text",
     "parts": [
      "Blunt version:\n\n**Cut now:**\n- **Cursor Pro ($20):** you stopped using it in January. Cancel today.\n- **Notion Plus ($10):** \"barely use.\" Free tier covers light use.\n- **YouTube Premium ($14):** keep only if you use background play daily; otherwise it's the easiest $14.\n\n**Consider:**\n- **Chess.com Diamond ($14):** lichess is free and excellent. Keep only if you use the lessons/analysis daily.\n- **Strava ($12):** if you mainly track runs and don't use routes/segments analysis, the free tier + Garmin Connect covers it.\n- **Amazon Prime ($15):** worth it only if you order often or watch Prime Video.\n\n**Keep:** ChatGPT/Claude (work tools; maybe drop one if they overlap for you), Spotify student, iCloud, NYT at $4.\n\nCutting Cursor + Notion + YouTube = **$44/month (~$528/yr)**. Adding chess + Strava gets you to **$70/month**."
     ]
    },
